WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Hey, home fries, it's CC Chapman
from accident hash, encouraging
you to check out

00:05.000 --> 00:07.000
BODOD.tv slash battle.

00:07.000 --> 00:17.000
It's one of the coolest battle
events out there, and you can
only find it at BODOD.tv.

00:17.000 --> 00:19.000
Boy, I learned my lesson.

00:19.000 --> 00:22.000
Don't stick the red pill in the
blue pill, in the same pocket.

00:22.000 --> 00:26.000
Especially on the day when it's
100 degrees out, you end up with
one purple glob.

00:26.000 --> 00:29.000
And if you take it, it feels
like you're on the DSC 648.

00:30.000 --> 00:34.000
With $60 million worth of
airplane strapped to my ass.

00:34.000 --> 00:38.000
Than the next generation radio
content in my ears.

00:40.000 --> 00:43.000
I like to think I'm flying into
the future.

